      "message": "The root cause is - in ConnectUtil.kt, it checkes if getConnectionInfo and network id is -1, otherwise it will not connect to a network.\nAfter disabling wifi the network connection info will not be cleared immediately - \nso we do need the polling wait before calling ConnectUtil.kt#ensureWifiConnected.\n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/android/frameworks/libs/net/common/testutils/devicetests/com/android/testutils/ConnectUtil.kt;rcl\u003d1254078fa148f780a6fe9056e4e5d7463709eae7;l\u003d67",
