      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for looking at this !\n\nIt seems to be a general problem with \"svc wifi disable\", where we expect that getNetworkId would be -1 after it returns, but it actually takes some time. So current usage of \"svc wifi disable\" is likely to not actually do what we expect.\n\nConsidering that, I think it would be useful to have a common method, instead of repeating the poll in 2 places here. Maybe mCtsNetUtils.disableWifi(), which would run the command and then poll ?\n\nThen you can replace current usages of the runShellCommand; there\u0027s the 2 in this file, but also one in CtsTetheringUtils that should probably be replaced too",
